---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";

const tahun = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-[#F3E6DD] bg-[#FFFCF8]">
  <div class="container-nm grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_1.1fr]">
    <div>
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5" aria-label="NurturaMom">
        <span class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#F3E6DD]">
          <img src="/logo.jpg" alt="Logo NurturaMom" class="h-11 w-11 object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </span>
        <span class="leading-none">
          <span class="block text-[22px] font-extrabold tracking-tight">
            <span class="text-[#7C9D8B]">nurtura</span><span class="text-[#BC7F8D]">mom</span>
          </span>
          <span class="mt-0.5 block text-[10.5px] font-medium text-[#8A7A7E]">Teman Sehat Ibu dan Anak</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <p data-i18n="foot.tag" class="mt-4 max-w-[290px] text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#8A7A7E]">
        Informasi kesehatan terpercaya untuk ibu dan anak. Ditinjau bidan, ditulis dengan bahasa yang mudah dipraktikkan.
      </p>
      <a href="/kalender-kehamilan" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#58293A] px-5 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-[#76304A]">
        <span data-i18n="foot.cta">Hitung HPL gratis</span>
        <Icon name="lucide:arrow-right" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
      </a>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="Navigasi footer">
      <p class="text-[12px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#58293A]" data-i18n="foot.navH">Navigasi</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[#3D2B30]/80">
        <li><a data-i18n="nav.home" class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/">Beranda</a></li>
        <li><a data-i18n="nav.preg" class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/kehamilan">Kehamilan</a></li>
        <li><a data-i18n="nav.birth" class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/persalinan">Persalinan</a></li>
        <li><a data-i18n="nav.nifas" class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/nifas">Nifas</a></li>
        <li><a class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/kalender-kehamilan">Kalender Kehamilan</a></li>
        <li><a class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/tools">Semua Tools</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <nav aria-label="Topik footer">
      <p class="text-[12px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#58293A]" data-i18n="foot.topH">Topik</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[#3D2B30]/80">
        <li><a data-i18n="nav.neo" class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/neonatus">Neonatus</a></li>
        <li><a data-i18n="nav.child" class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/anak">Anak</a></li>
        <li><a data-i18n="nav.repro" class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/reproduksi-kb">Reproduksi dan KB</a></li>
        <li><a data-i18n="nav.art" class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/artikel">Artikel</a></li>
        <li><a class="transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/tentang-bidan">Tentang Kami</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div>
      <p class="text-[12px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#58293A]" data-i18n="foot.conH">Kontak</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[#3D2B30]/80">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#FFF4EC]"><Icon name="lucide:mail" class="h-4 w-4 text-[#9C3D5C]" /></span>
          <a href="mailto:hello@nurturamom.id" class="hover:text-[#9C3D5C]">hello@nurturamom.id</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#FFF4EC]"><Icon name="lucide:map-pin" class="h-4 w-4 text-[#9C3D5C]" /></span>
          <span>Indonesia</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <a href="#" aria-label="Instagram NurturaMom" class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#F3E6DD] bg-white transition hover:-translate-y-px hover:border-[#9C3D5C] hover:text-[#9C3D5C]">
          <Icon name="lucide:instagram" class="h-4 w-4" />
        </a>
        <a href="#" aria-label="Facebook NurturaMom" class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#F3E6DD] bg-white transition hover:-translate-y-px hover:border-[#9C3D5C] hover:text-[#9C3D5C]">
          <Icon name="lucide:facebook" class="h-4 w-4" />
        </a>
        <a href="#" aria-label="Youtube NurturaMom" class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#F3E6DD] bg-white transition hover:-translate-y-px hover:border-[#9C3D5C] hover:text-[#9C3D5C]">
          <Icon name="lucide:youtube" class="h-4 w-4" />
        </a>
        <a href="#" aria-label="Tiktok NurturaMom" class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#F3E6DD] bg-white transition hover:-translate-y-px hover:border-[#9C3D5C] hover:text-[#9C3D5C]">
          <Icon name="lucide:music-2" class="h-4 w-4" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-[#F3E6DD] bg-[#FFF8F1]">
    <div class="container-nm flex flex-col gap-2 py-5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#8A7A7E] md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <p data-i18n="foot.dis" class="max-w-[660px]">
        Informasi di nurturamom bersifat edukatif dan bukan pengganti konsultasi tenaga kesehatan. Segera ke faskes bila ada tanda bahaya.
      </p>
      <p class="shrink-0">© {tahun} nurturamom. <span data-i18n="foot.rights">All rights reserved.</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
